  "historyNote": "#2325, eff 3-28-83; ss by #3019, eff 5-14-85; EXPIRED: 5-14-91 New. #5679, eff 8-4-93, EXPIRED: 8-4-99 New. #7093, INTERIM, eff 9-9-99, EXPIRES: 1-7-00; ss by #7187, eff 1-8-00, EXPIRED: 1-8-08 New. #9081-B, eff 1-29-08; ss by #11176, eff 9-16-16; amd by #12378-B, eff 9-13-17",
